---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Refund Policy — Vandhara Agrotech">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-20 prose prose-green">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green">Shipping &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <h2>Shipping</h2>
    <p>Vandhara Agrotech products are shipped from our manufacturing facility in Morbi, Gujarat. We currently serve customers across India, with a focus on South Indian states (Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Telangana, Kerala).</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Orders are processed within 3-5 business days of confirmation</li>
      <li>Shipping timelines vary by location — typically 5-10 business days after dispatch</li>
      <li>Bulk orders may require special freight arrangements</li>
      <li>Shipping charges are calculated based on order value and destination</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Orders can be cancelled within 24 hours of confirmation without any charges</li>
      <li>Cancellations after dispatch are subject to return shipping costs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Return &amp; Refund Policy</h2>
    <p>We take great care in packaging and quality assurance. However, if you receive a damaged or defective product:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Contact us within 48 hours of delivery at <a href="mailto:vandharaagrotech@gmail.com">vandharaagrotech@gmail.com</a> or +91 63592 99124</li>
      <li>Provide your order number and photos of the damaged product</li>
      <li>We will arrange a replacement or issue a refund after verification</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Refunds are processed within 7-10 business days after approval and will be credited to the original payment method.</p>

    <h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2>
    <p>Due to the nature of agricultural inputs, we cannot accept returns on:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Products that have been opened or partially used</li>
      <li>Products damaged due to improper storage after delivery</li>
      <li>Orders cancelled after dispatch (return shipping applies)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Quality Guarantee</h2>
    <p>Our products are manufactured in compliance with FCO and NPOP standards. If you have concerns about product quality, please contact us — we are committed to your satisfaction.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For shipping or refund enquiries:<br>
    <a href="mailto:vandharaagrotech@gmail.com">vandharaagrotech@gmail.com</a><br>
    +91 63592 99124</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
